From: Oreon Packaging Team <packaging@oreonhq.com>
Subject: drm: allow libdisplay-info 0.2.x

Weston 14 widens the pkg-config range to < 0.3.0. libdisplay-info 0.2.0
satisfies >= 0.1.1 but failed the old < 0.2.0 cap, so HAVE_LIBDISPLAY_INFO
was unset even when the library was installed.

---
 libweston/backend-drm/meson.build | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libweston/backend-drm/meson.build b/libweston/backend-drm/meson.build
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/libweston/backend-drm/meson.build
+++ b/libweston/backend-drm/meson.build
@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@ endif
 
 dep_libdisplay_info = dependency(
 	'libdisplay-info',
-	version: ['>= 0.1.1', '< 0.2.0'],
+	version: ['>= 0.1.1', '< 0.3.0'],
 	fallback: ['display-info', 'di_dep'],
 	default_options: [
 		'werror=false',
